        {
          "id": 2540275881,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> How do I trigger a macOS build pipeline?\n\nIt's supposed to happen automatically, but it appears not to have started macOS *or* Windows builds. @geraldcombs, any idea what might be happening here?",
